  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nWhere is Lucy? Your girlfriend is not at home at the time of your meeting. Could the Mark-13 cyclops, who enforces martial law, have something to do with it? Find out by diving into the dark and immersive world of Downware, a first-person Cyberpunk horror game.<p></p>\n<p>John heads to the heart of the city to visit his girlfriend Lucy. After falling asleep while waiting for her, he finds himself trapped in her apartment due to a malfunctioning security system. With a building filled with all sorts of traps and a cyborg tasked with enforcing the country’s tyrannical law, John’s grim fate seems sealed. Will he manage to escape the building and outwit the cyborg to avoid his dire fate?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complex Puzzles – Discover secret hideouts essential for your survival: An apartment filled with secrets; New areas to explore; A story to uncover.\n</li><li>Chase Sequences – Run away to escape the enemy: He hears, sees, and detects your movement; Set traps to ensnare him; Every decision counts!\n</li><li>Cyberpunk Environment – Immerse yourself in the heart of an oppressive cyberpunk city: Various apartments, corridors, and areas to explore; A sound and visual atmosphere that complements the plot; A world filled with dangers.\n</li></ul>\n",
